_meta.notes:
Body callback webhook Blibli FLAT (tanpa envelope requestId/content) — TIDAK sama dengan response API REST. Header tiap callback: Accept, Content-Type, requestId, requestTime (ms), opsional token (OAUTH) & signature (Webhook Signature Key). Event operation path dipilih partner saat subscribe (contoh /deliveredOrder/regular) sehingga event type harus dianut dari isi body (orderStatus), bukan path. orderStatus: FP=new order, PU=ready for pickup, BP=BOPIS, OS=out of stock, PF=partial fulfillment, CR=customer request, D=delivered. Signature (opsional): HMAC-SHA256(key, rawString = `${method}
${md5hex(body)}
${contentType}
${date}
${callbackUrl}`). ACK: HTTP 200; retry 1x/jam s.d. 7x (guide lain bilang 24x; idempoten wajib).
